  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Resilience of communities and enhancing Strategies for Managing Sand and Dust Storms in I.R.Iran</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sand and Dust Storms (SDS) represent prevalent environmental hazards, particularly in semiarid and arid regions, caused by natural factors and human activities. The transboundary nature of SDS poses formidable challenges at both national and international levels due to their capacity to transcend national borders, adversely impacting multiple countries.This project aims to address SDS challenges in pilot provinces through adaptive and mitigative measures, supporting the government in creating me</narrative>
  </description>
